  "contentHtml": "<p>2023.08.29. 많이 활용해주셔서 감사합니다. 댓글로 자료를 요청하시는 분들이 계셔서 말씀드립니다.&#160;<b>개인사정으로 더 공유해드리기가 어렵습니다.</b> 이 점 양해해 주시기 바랍니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm</a>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Gather\" data-og-description=\"Gather is a video-calling space that lets multiple people hold separate conversations in parallel, walking in and out of those conversations just as easily as they would in real life.\" data-og-host=\"app.gather.town\" data-og-source-url=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" data-og-url=\"https://app.gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qK93f/hyTL3uyLnV/J9epTZV5w8KPxhIc1M3rT1/img.png?width=1060&amp;height=642&amp;face=0_0_1060_642\"><a href=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qK93f/hyTL3uyLnV/J9epTZV5w8KPxhIc1M3rT1/img.png?width=1060&amp;height=642&amp;face=0_0_1060_642\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Gather</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Gather is a video-calling space that lets multiple people hold separate conversations in parallel, walking in and out of those conversations just as easily as they would in real life.</p><p class=\"og-host\">app.gather.town</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Gather\" data-og-description=\"Gather is a video-calling space that lets multiple people hold separate conversations in parallel, walking in and out of those conversations just as easily as they would in real life.\" data-og-host=\"gather.town\" data-og-source-url=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" data-og-url=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/96Yqg/hyMlsWNzW3/ySuexJatO9lTFBWOAAGFkk/img.png?width=635&amp;height=380&amp;face=0_0_635_380\"><a href=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://gather.town/invite?token=9RZJ0ePzvhfLhN7YxBP6sBnkER1XeLPm\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/96Yqg/hyMlsWNzW3/ySuexJatO9lTFBWOAAGFkk/img.png?width=635&amp;height=380&amp;face=0_0_635_380\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Gather</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Gather is a video-calling space that lets multiple people hold separate conversations in parallel, walking in and out of those conversations just as easily as they would in real life.</p><p class=\"og-host\">gather.town</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;저번에 만들었던 4단원 문제 풀이 후 학생들의 반응이 좋아 5단원도 만들어봤습니다.&#160;</p><p>5단원은 비밀번호를 찾고, 문도 찾아서, 열고 들어가게끔 만들었습니다.&#160;&#160;</p><p>비밀번호는 15a3db94e023 입니다.&#160; 비밀번호 문은 처음 시작하는 맵에서 왼쪽으로 아래쪽으로 가면 있습니다.&#160;</p><p>맵은 크게 4부분으로 나누어져 있습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/925e874ce3f9d178dc1223c35210154e1675ff1f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/925e874ce3f9d178dc1223c35210154e1675ff1f\" data-origin-width=\"597\" data-origin-height=\"651\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ba4c2a85fb2f2d898dadc1d8ee90ae26713d6e7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ba4c2a85fb2f2d898dadc1d8ee90ae26713d6e7\" data-origin-width=\"655\" data-origin-height=\"691\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9fa03280effc6c469f842be1b5340727fa4e8dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9fa03280effc6c469f842be1b5340727fa4e8dd\" data-origin-width=\"630\" data-origin-height=\"701\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a2347ff3cd0bd6525c99a4e7d233ebe4ecd8a44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a2347ff3cd0bd6525c99a4e7d233ebe4ecd8a44\" data-origin-width=\"644\" data-origin-height=\"695\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래 사진은 선생님들께서 하실 수 있는 방법 소개입니다.</p><p><u><b>하고싶으신 분은 메일주소 댓글로 남겨주시면 보내드리겠습니다.&#160;</b></u><u></u></p><p>보내드린 후 아래 사진처럼 하신 후 학생들에게 링크 주면 같이 하실 수 있습니다.</p><p>하나씩 스페이스를 만들어 드리기가 번거로워 링크에 있는 스페이스의 소유권을 드릴 예정입니다.&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><u><b>절대 내용 수정하지 마시고 복사해주시기 바랍니다.</b></u></span></p><p>먼저 게더타운에 회원가입을 하시고 그 회원가입한&#160;이메일을 알려주셔야 보내드릴수있었습니다. 가입하시고 답글주시면 보내드리겠습니다.</p><p>단점: 25명이상이 한 spece에 들어가면 안정적이지 않을 수 있습니다. 만약 25명이상이면 spece를 2개 이상 만드는 것을 추천합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54406b7968cfcad9a8641368311bcdd3e7e1d11e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54406b7968cfcad9a8641368311bcdd3e7e1d11e\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"866\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1d2856ab5de6bd4d5f5082cbd5bf89f52ca13cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1d2856ab5de6bd4d5f5082cbd5bf89f52ca13cb\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"615\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4dca561d27afdac52677d7f5588ff4523bae76f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4dca561d27afdac52677d7f5588ff4523bae76f\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"774\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f1237389e1f674cdb25a0c7b9ffbd5cc482b921\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f1237389e1f674cdb25a0c7b9ffbd5cc482b921\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"741\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e9f8934df8d099abc9f3f8303787491a07f3383\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e9f8934df8d099abc9f3f8303787491a07f3383\" data-origin-width=\"1224\" data-origin-height=\"746\"><div class=\"figcaption\">- 링크 만드는 방법 -</div></div><p>ㅠㅜ 새로 방을 만들면 다시 비밀번호를 세팅해야합니다.</p><p>15a3db94e023&#160; 실제 아바타로 들어간 후 아래 편집하다누르시고 비밀번호 업데이트를 해야합니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc8752aa5d84f1156e42532e477648d0fd9c5db0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc8752aa5d84f1156e42532e477648d0fd9c5db0\" data-origin-width=\"671\" data-origin-height=\"343\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f49dd0f634d540563d446a42daa4b1e3b969409\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"675\" height=\"419\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f49dd0f634d540563d446a42daa4b1e3b969409\" data-origin-width=\"671\" data-origin-height=\"416\"></div><p>&#160;아래 자료는 게더타운 방 만드는 방법입니다.(수업ideas에 올렸습니다.)&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/622\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/622</a></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
